# Deprecated since 2.4, removed in 4.0.
#
# The static template path this extension offered up to version 2.3. It is
# stored in TypoScript records and imported by site packages, so it keeps
# delivering the files of the component folder below, as "All components"
# does. The TypoScript of EXT:academic_persons, which "All components" brings
# along, is not included here: in version 2.3 it came from an entry of its own
# in the same record, and including it again would read it twice. Select
# "Academic Contacts4Pages: All components", or depend on the site set,
# instead.
@import 'EXT:academic_contacts4pages/Configuration/TypoScript/List/setup.typoscript'
